@startuml
title Answer submission and progress notification
actor Learner
participant LessonSessionPanel as UI
participant LessonFacade as Facade
participant "FeedbackDecorator\n(HintDecorator(Exercise))" as Exercise
participant ProgressTracker as Tracker
participant "ProgressObserver subscribers" as Observers
Learner -> UI : Check answer
UI -> Facade : submitAnswer(answer)
Facade -> Facade : reject blank / repeated / completed
Facade -> Exercise : checkAnswer(answer)
Exercise --> Facade : AnswerResult
Facade -> Facade : save result and round score
Facade -> Tracker : recordAnswer(exerciseId, result)
Tracker -> Tracker : update counters and enqueue snapshot
loop each subscriber (errors isolated)
Tracker -> Observers : onProgressUpdated(snapshot)
end
Facade --> UI : AnswerResult
UI -> UI : show feedback, enable Next
Learner -> UI : Next exercise
UI -> Facade : nextExercise()
@enduml
